OL,3,GNEWSAArt students get sneak peek of new
OL,4,Acity studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FArts students have been given a sneak
OL,7,Fpeek of a new creative content studio
OL,8,Fthey hope will support their careers.
OL,10,FNewcastle College photography and music
OL,11,Fstudents had a chance to try out
OL,12,Ffacilities at the #1.8m Quayside
OL,13,FStudios, funded by the North East
OL,14,FMayoral Strategic Authority (NEMSA),
OL,15,Fwith support from the city council.
OL,17,FG Thompson, 29, is doing a photography
OL,18,Fdegree and said it was great to try out
OL,19,Fa professional set-up.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
