OL,3,GNEWSAArt students get sneak peek of new
OL,4,Acity studio
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We don't really have anything like
OL,7,Fthis in the city. There's a few
OL,8,F[studios] that you can rent for like
OL,9,F#500 a day, which doesn't allow working
OL,10,Fclass people to take advantage of it,
OL,11,Fwhich I don't think is very fair."
